{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20033",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.39,
      "end_seconds": 6.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Mm, hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.57,
      "end_seconds": 14.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.89,
      "end_seconds": 37.12,
      "duration_seconds": 21.23,
      "text": "It's a bump on my head. I thought I'd wait, um, but it hasn't gone. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.48,
      "end_seconds": 40.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Okay, when did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.12,
      "end_seconds": 45.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "It's been going on for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.87,
      "end_seconds": 50.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.96,
      "end_seconds": 63.52,
      "duration_seconds": 11.56,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a sore neck as well. With sore neck, a five out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.28,
      "end_seconds": 66.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Have you been feeling dizzy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.84,
      "end_seconds": 71.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.53,
      "end_seconds": 75.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.57,
      "end_seconds": 94.96,
      "duration_seconds": 17.39,
      "text": "Okay, so yes, I had a varicose vein procedure, last year. I've been reading about it online and it worried me. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.58,
      "end_seconds": 100.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.16,
      "end_seconds": 113.11,
      "duration_seconds": 11.95,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day. I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.83,
      "end_seconds": 116.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.85,
      "end_seconds": 118.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Nothing regular, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.29,
      "end_seconds": 140.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.91,
      "end_seconds": 144.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.96,
      "end_seconds": 148.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Have you had loss of consciousness, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.66,
      "end_seconds": 152.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Nope, no loss of consciousness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.81,
      "end_seconds": 156.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "A few quick ones: double vision, weakness or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.74,
      "end_seconds": 163.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "I haven't had double vision, weakness or vomiting, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.12,
      "end_seconds": 171.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.43,
      "end_seconds": 175.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "That's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 177.31,
      "end_seconds": 189.3,
      "duration_seconds": 11.99,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pressure 128 over 74, temp 36.7 degrees, saturation 98 percent. Respiratory rate 14, pulse is 81 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.78,
      "end_seconds": 191.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.96,
      "end_seconds": 197.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.89,
      "end_seconds": 211.59,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.18,
      "end_seconds": 215.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.38,
      "end_seconds": 238.38,
      "duration_seconds": 9.0,
      "text": "There is a small bruise on the forehead, the pupils are equal and reactive, and you are walking steadily."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.44,
      "end_seconds": 245.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.24,
      "end_seconds": 261.9,
      "duration_seconds": 8.66,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. This is probably a minor head injury without worrying signs. We shouldn't forget a neck strain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.39,
      "end_seconds": 264.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.79,
      "end_seconds": 297.06,
      "duration_seconds": 30.27,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a minor head injury without worrying signs, and we'll watch how it goes. I'm going to put you on paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours if needed, for three days. It's for headache. Someone should stay with you tonight, and no alcohol or contact sport for now. Let's review you if the headache gets worse. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.26,
      "end_seconds": 303.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.94,
      "end_seconds": 305.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}